04:00.120 --> 04:00.780
Abang Rong!

04:00.910 --> 04:01.570
Abang Rong!

04:01.800 --> 04:02.700
Tangkap dia!

04:03.080 --> 04:03.740
Abang Rong!

04:03.840 --> 04:04.500
Abang Rong!

04:07.710 --> 04:08.710
Jangan bergerak.

04:10.430 --> 04:11.890
Awak pun jangan bergerak.

04:27.410 --> 04:28.140
Cepat!

04:29.430 --> 04:30.630
Helo, Timbalan Ketua Biro Zhang.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.580
