04:31.580 --> 04:32.460
Dah nak sampai.

04:33.630 --> 04:34.690
Mari, guna tenaga.

04:34.750 --> 04:35.159
Cepat!

04:36.390 --> 04:37.000
Kuat lagi!

04:37.750 --> 04:39.680
