06:06.480 --> 06:07.190
Abang Rong, ada...

06:07.190 --> 06:07.830
Ada polis!

06:09.310 --> 06:10.240
Letakkan pistol!

06:10.240 --> 06:10.840
Berundur!

06:12.070 --> 06:12.830
Letakkan pistol.

06:12.830 --> 06:13.750
Awak letakkan pistol.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.680
Letak!

06:15.360 --> 06:16.560
Letak.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.610
Letaklah!

06:18.000 --> 06:18.630
Letaklah.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.630
Letaklah.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.720
Letakkan pistol.

06:29.680 --> 06:31.140
Jangan berpura-puralah.

06:31.270 --> 06:32.000
