09:28.680 --> 09:29.890
♪ Dia ♪

09:28.910 --> 09:29.720
Li Qian!

09:40.550 --> 09:41.010
Saya...

09:41.030 --> 09:41.480
Timbalan ketua biro.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.340
Saya pun tak...

09:43.150 --> 09:44.270
Tuan duduk segera.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.000
Baring sekejap okeylah ini.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.920
Baring sekejap okeylah ini.

